<title>SPAIN: Spain May currency reserves rose $499.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Spain May currency reserves rose $499.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following provisional figures (millions of dollars) :</p>
<p> RESERVES		     MAY 97	APR 97    MAY 96</p>
<p> Rise/fall in month	499.2	   728.3    3,134.3</p>
<p> End-month total	66,402.9	65,903.7   53,140.4</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
